{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "acf566eb-d1ea-4b4d-9674-1c1d1f0a413b",
    "name": "GoodPlay Games API",
    "description": "Complete game engine and management API endpoints\n\nThis collection covers:\n- Game CRUD and discovery\n- Session management with cross-device sync\n- Game modes and scheduling\n- Direct challenges and matchmaking\n- Team management and tournaments\n- Multiplayer room invitations (GOO-60)\n\n## Environment Variables\n- `{{baseUrl}}` - API base URL\n- `{{access_token}}` - JWT access token\n- `{{game_id}}` - Current game ID\n- `{{session_id}}` - Current session ID\n- `{{challenge_id}}` - Current challenge ID\n- `{{team_id}}` - Current team ID\n- `{{room_id}}` - Current multiplayer room ID\n- `{{invitation_id}}` - Current invitation ID\n- `{{recipient_user_id}}` - Recipient user ID for invitations",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
